    "detailed_reasoning": "Ran `C:\\Users\\there\\.elan\\bin\\lean.EXE C:\\dev\\PRIN\\EVIDENCE\\math-audit\\scratch\\lean\\tmpe2d5tl4v.lean`. Elaboration succeeded. See lean-diagnostics.txt artifact for full sanitized output.",
    "normalized_inputs": {
